WEBVTT

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:45.250
<i>we wanna be there even if we had to</i>
<i>twist the world all around to get there</i>

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:56.125
<i>without you, i guess i couldn't</i>
<i>even find the future here today</i>

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:07.125
<i>i was always trying to take nothing for granted</i>

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:15.125
<i>for the day i might lose them</i>

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:22.167
<i>but you just came in to my black</i>
<i>and white monochrome destiny</i>

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:32.375
<i>and colored it all over</i>

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:39.708
<i>we won't be satisfied with the routine future</i>

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:47.167
<i>we were born to make a new history come true</i>

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:54.333
<i>there's absolutely no</i>
<i>absolute thing in this world</i>

00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:58.917
<i>this road goes on forever</i>

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:05.042
<i>as long as we won't give up</i>

00:02:16.958 --> 00:02:19.542
Yahoo!

00:02:34.167 --> 00:02:37.250
"Battle Festival"

00:03:01.458 --> 00:03:02.458
Well?

00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:04.458
She's behaving herself.

00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:08.333
She may be grounded, but there's
no need to stand guard, right?

00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:09.917
There's no choice.

00:03:09.917 --> 00:03:15.000
Sid-<i>sensei </i>has been killed,
Meme is missing, and Anya is going home.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.042
We may not know exactly what's going on,

00:03:17.042 --> 00:03:19.708
but the fact that Meme
is one of their suspects is...

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:22.500
Where's Anya?

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:27.583
It sounds like her escort is here.
From DWMA, straight to the airport.

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:29.667
I heard she won't be stopping by here.

00:03:35.167 --> 00:03:37.292
Yes?

00:03:37.292 --> 00:03:40.125
Princess, let's be off.

00:03:42.583 --> 00:03:44.750
Th-Thank you...

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:54.542
I will be taking Sid's place
and heading things up for a while.

00:03:54.542 --> 00:03:56.042
I'm sorry about all this, but...

00:04:01.833 --> 00:04:02.833
If you would.

00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:04.375
Right.

00:04:06.708 --> 00:04:09.708
"Their Various Resolves!"

00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:20.917
Traffic jam, huh?

00:04:20.917 --> 00:04:22.667
It's the Battle Festival.

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:24.208
Now, of all times...

00:04:24.208 --> 00:04:26.833
That's the kind of school this is.

00:04:40.917 --> 00:04:48.208
Kill them... Kill them...
Killed... Kill... Kill them...

00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:49.708
Kill them...

00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:54.333
--The real harvest festival starts right now.
--Killed...  Kill them... Kill...

00:05:03.958 --> 00:05:05.250
Huh?!

00:05:07.625 --> 00:05:10.083
Are they DWMA students, too?

00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:11.958
Watch yourself.

00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:13.708
They're acting strangely.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.125
Poison?!

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:28.125
What the...?

00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:33.625
It looks like they're making their move.

00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:35.083
Damn!

00:05:42.917 --> 00:05:46.917
You would assault me, knowing that
I am the Lightning King Commander?!

00:05:46.917 --> 00:05:48.708
Ox!

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:50.208
Are you okay?!

00:05:51.792 --> 00:05:54.458
Let me take care of this!
You hurry up and get to safety!

00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:57.083
Ox, sir, get in the car, quickly!

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:58.917
Don't open that!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.500
Please, do not die!

00:06:04.417 --> 00:06:06.083
Start driving!

00:06:25.958 --> 00:06:28.000
What's going on here?

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:32.542
Everyone who comes after me,
whoever they are, I'll kick their butts!

00:06:32.542 --> 00:06:34.208
Don't go overdoing it.

00:06:34.208 --> 00:06:35.875
Just leave it to me!

00:06:42.708 --> 00:06:44.542
What in the world is going on?!

00:06:44.542 --> 00:06:46.000
Give me a situation report!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.833
NOT students are running
wild all over the place!

00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:51.125
We can't make contact with
the Battle Festival grounds!

00:06:51.125 --> 00:06:53.667
Getting multiple assistance
calls from the police!

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:54.958
Any witch readings?

00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:56.375
Unable to verify.

00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:58.042
Contact Dr. Stein!

00:06:58.042 --> 00:06:58.875
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:58.875 --> 00:07:01.542
Call an emergency summons! Get everyone in here!

00:07:07.417 --> 00:07:10.458
This year's Battle Festival is
getting really charged up, huh?

00:07:10.458 --> 00:07:13.333
This is no time for jokes!

00:07:13.333 --> 00:07:15.083
How is the antidote coming?

00:07:15.083 --> 00:07:17.500
I've got some fine samples here.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.250
Just a little bit longer.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.917
Forgive me, but please hurry!

00:07:25.375 --> 00:07:28.000
Man, what a slave driver.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.583
The girls' dorm is being locked down?

00:07:29.583 --> 00:07:31.125
What's going on?

00:07:31.125 --> 00:07:33.708
I don't know all the details,

00:07:33.708 --> 00:07:37.875
but the Battle Festival grounds
are under attack all over.

00:07:37.875 --> 00:07:40.375
And you're saying we may soon
be under attack here, as well?

00:07:40.375 --> 00:07:44.792
What's worse, the ones doing the
attacking appear to be NOT students.

00:07:44.792 --> 00:07:45.917
In any event,

00:07:45.917 --> 00:07:48.292
to keep the casualties
from spreading any further,

00:07:48.292 --> 00:07:51.917
no one will be allowed in or
out of the girls' dorm for a while.

00:07:54.125 --> 00:07:56.250
You think this is the doing of that witch?

00:08:00.375 --> 00:08:03.833
Yow-w-w...

00:08:05.458 --> 00:08:06.833
What are you doing?!

00:08:06.833 --> 00:08:08.458
I have to go!

00:08:08.458 --> 00:08:09.375
Huh?

00:08:09.375 --> 00:08:11.458
Meme could be out there!

00:08:11.458 --> 00:08:14.542
You can't! We're not allowed
out of the girls' dorm today!

00:08:14.542 --> 00:08:16.917
And you're grounded in the first place.

00:08:16.917 --> 00:08:19.208
Even so, I have to go.

00:08:19.208 --> 00:08:21.083
Meme is waiting for me.

00:08:21.083 --> 00:08:23.542
What can you do all by yourself?

00:08:24.667 --> 00:08:27.917
I won't be alone! Miss Anya is out there, too!

00:08:27.917 --> 00:08:30.667
But she's well on her way to the airport.

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:33.292
Still, I made a promise!

00:08:33.292 --> 00:08:35.750
I promised that I'd pick either
Miss Anya or Meme as my partner

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:39.000
by the end of the day!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.458
I still haven't told either one how I feel!

00:08:42.458 --> 00:08:44.625
Have you decided on one or the other?

00:08:45.667 --> 00:08:47.708
Not yet.

00:08:47.708 --> 00:08:48.625
Ow!

00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:50.583
Calm down a bit, will you?

00:08:52.417 --> 00:08:55.667
Still, somehow, I can tell...

00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:59.583
Miss Anya isn't going to
leave us here and go home.

00:09:00.583 --> 00:09:07.708
When Mr. Clay snapped at Miss Anya,
she was probably very mad.

00:09:07.708 --> 00:09:11.458
About how everyone was secretly
deciding things without asking her,

00:09:11.458 --> 00:09:15.917
and mad at herself, for not realizing it sooner.

00:09:15.917 --> 00:09:19.167
It must have been awfully frustrating.

00:09:19.167 --> 00:09:23.208
When I called out to her,
and she didn't look back at me,

00:09:23.208 --> 00:09:26.333
she probably just didn't want me to see her...

00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:29.375
...crying out of frustration.

00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:36.042
That's why Miss Anya... won't
go home feeling the way she does.

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:38.042
Soul resonance?

00:09:41.042 --> 00:09:42.167
Kim...

00:09:45.875 --> 00:09:49.000
Tsugumi, this is not a game.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.375
I know.

00:09:50.375 --> 00:09:51.458
Even so...

00:09:51.458 --> 00:09:54.333
Well, your injury's no big deal.

00:09:54.333 --> 00:09:57.750
Right! It's all about mind over matter!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:58.417
Ow!

00:09:58.417 --> 00:10:01.583
Don't get in over your head.
You're still a weakling.

00:10:07.542 --> 00:10:08.917
Sure about this?

00:10:08.917 --> 00:10:11.083
I know what she's going through.

00:10:11.083 --> 00:10:14.750
Wanting to protect someone dear
to her, even if it mean breaking rules.

00:10:23.958 --> 00:10:25.292
Housemaster!

00:10:25.292 --> 00:10:28.000
Miss Tsugumi...

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.667
I'm sorry, but I simply must--

00:10:30.667 --> 00:10:33.333
It's all right. Go ahead.

00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:33.833
Huh?

00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:37.833
Such vitality is just right
for the Commoner of Flanders!

00:10:37.833 --> 00:10:40.167
This is just the Mary that I wanted!

00:10:40.167 --> 00:10:41.708
Okay...

00:10:41.708 --> 00:10:42.583
Need this?

00:10:42.583 --> 00:10:44.000
No, thanks.

00:10:54.833 --> 00:10:56.750
Please stop the car.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.833
Huh?

00:10:57.833 --> 00:11:01.042
I have to stay at Miss Tsugumi's side right now.

00:11:01.042 --> 00:11:02.292
Are you still on about that?

00:11:02.292 --> 00:11:04.208
You know, <i>I...</i>

00:11:04.208 --> 00:11:08.583
...feel just as sad about
Sid-<i>sensei </i>being killed as<i> you </i>do.

00:11:08.583 --> 00:11:11.958
Especially since it was Miss Meme...

00:11:11.958 --> 00:11:14.792
Right now, with the people I care for suffering,

00:11:14.792 --> 00:11:17.208
there's no way I can leave them
and go home, is there?!

00:11:17.208 --> 00:11:17.958
Even so...

00:11:17.958 --> 00:11:22.292
Just like earlier! Why didn't you help Mr. Ox?!

00:11:22.292 --> 00:11:23.083
That was--

00:11:23.083 --> 00:11:25.792
I'm still a DWMA student!

00:11:25.792 --> 00:11:29.958
Please stop treating me
like a helpless little girl!

00:11:29.958 --> 00:11:33.458
Hurry up and stop! Alfred, that's an order!

00:11:33.458 --> 00:11:34.708
Princess! Please, stop that!

00:11:34.708 --> 00:11:35.958
H-Hey!

00:11:35.958 --> 00:11:37.333
Now!

00:11:51.292 --> 00:11:56.833
Everyone stopped coming, huh?
Even after we did all this decorating.

00:11:56.833 --> 00:12:00.833
The Battle Festival is in full swing, huh?

00:12:00.833 --> 00:12:03.000
Miss Liz! Miss Patty!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.000
Oh, Tsugumi...

00:12:05.917 --> 00:12:06.583
What's wrong?

00:12:06.583 --> 00:12:08.875
Miss Liz! I need to ask you for something!

00:12:08.875 --> 00:12:09.875
Candy?

00:12:09.875 --> 00:12:13.500
No, not that. Miss Anya
is going back to her home,

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:17.208
and is headed to the airport.
I want to go and get her,

00:12:17.208 --> 00:12:18.708
but there's too much going on in town!

00:12:18.708 --> 00:12:21.083
The buses aren't running,
but still, I have to go--

00:12:21.083 --> 00:12:23.792
Stop hounding us and get to the point!

00:12:24.708 --> 00:12:25.542
Master!

00:12:25.542 --> 00:12:27.542
Trick or Treat!

00:12:27.542 --> 00:12:28.375
Hmm?

00:12:28.375 --> 00:12:29.958
We need to borrow your scooter.

00:12:29.958 --> 00:12:31.042
Huh?

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:35.417
Just make sure to be careful.

00:12:35.417 --> 00:12:37.083
Let us worry about that!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.500
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.542
Stay outta my way, or you're dead!

00:12:43.542 --> 00:12:45.458
Hey! Miss Liz!

00:12:49.833 --> 00:12:51.708
It doesn't look like we'll get it running again.

00:12:51.708 --> 00:12:52.292
No.

00:12:52.292 --> 00:12:55.125
I'll call and get us another car.

00:12:55.125 --> 00:12:57.042
I'm going back to town.

00:12:57.042 --> 00:12:58.250
Huh? Hey!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.417
One moment please, Princess.

00:13:01.417 --> 00:13:06.583
Our mission is to see you safely to the airport.

00:13:06.583 --> 00:13:09.625
We cannot very well say
"Oh, all right," and allow you to go back.

00:13:09.625 --> 00:13:11.292
You understand, don't you?

00:13:11.292 --> 00:13:13.042
No, I don't!

00:13:13.042 --> 00:13:16.250
If your mission is to give up
your lives, abandon your friends,

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:19.167
and renounce yourselves, body and soul,

00:13:19.167 --> 00:13:22.208
then you should toss it down the drain!

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.750
I see we have little choice, huh?

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:29.792
Hey...

00:13:29.792 --> 00:13:31.625
Clay, you stay there and watch.

00:13:31.625 --> 00:13:35.792
We can't very well turn your
blade toward the unarmed princess.

00:13:35.792 --> 00:13:39.625
I don't need your pity! This is a real fight!

00:13:39.625 --> 00:13:43.625
If this were a real fight,
you wouldn't issue such a warning,

00:13:43.625 --> 00:13:45.667
my proud princess.

00:13:46.958 --> 00:13:51.125
I am going back to Miss Tsugumi,
no matter what I have to do.

00:13:51.125 --> 00:13:52.792
I cannot let you go.

00:13:57.042 --> 00:14:00.208
Oh, my! What's a witch doing over there?!

00:14:00.208 --> 00:14:01.458
Where?!

00:14:14.708 --> 00:14:16.792
Hey, that was sneaky!

00:14:16.792 --> 00:14:19.542
Let me go! I'll bite my tongue and kill myself!

00:14:19.542 --> 00:14:24.042
Even if you do go back,
Harudori may have already given up.

00:14:24.042 --> 00:14:26.333
That is quite impossible!

00:14:26.333 --> 00:14:29.208
Miss Tsugumi is definitely
waiting for me to return--

00:14:29.208 --> 00:14:31.042
Miss Anya!

00:14:35.292 --> 00:14:37.917
Miss Anya! And Akane, too!

00:14:37.917 --> 00:14:42.042
What are you doing?! There's a crisis going on!

00:14:42.042 --> 00:14:44.667
This is no time for you to be making out!

00:14:44.667 --> 00:14:46.292
Making out?

00:14:49.458 --> 00:14:52.500
Miss Tsugumi, I'm sorry for everything.

00:14:57.917 --> 00:15:02.875
It's all right. Never mind that,
we have to hurry and find Meme.

00:15:02.875 --> 00:15:03.542
Right!

00:15:03.542 --> 00:15:05.917
What will you do when you find her?

00:15:05.917 --> 00:15:08.542
Unless you can release
Tatane from Shaula's mind control,

00:15:08.542 --> 00:15:11.208
you'll just end up killing each other.

00:15:11.208 --> 00:15:14.750
Besides, Shaula could be at Tatane's side.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.083
Huh?

00:15:16.083 --> 00:15:19.000
For Shaula, who is using
Soul Protect to hide herself from DWMA,

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.583
and is thus unable to use magic,

00:15:21.583 --> 00:15:24.667
Tatane would be a special pawn.

00:15:24.667 --> 00:15:27.208
In order to maximize her power,
there's a high probability

00:15:27.208 --> 00:15:31.042
that she is overseeing things from a distance
where she can directly control everything.

00:15:33.125 --> 00:15:35.667
Even so...

00:15:35.667 --> 00:15:37.917
Maybe we can't do anything about it,

00:15:37.917 --> 00:15:40.917
but right now, all we
can do is try to find Meme!

00:15:40.917 --> 00:15:42.625
Let's go, Miss Tsugumi!

00:15:42.625 --> 00:15:45.750
Mm-hmm! Then again...

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.167
Three people aren't gonna fit on this.

00:15:50.042 --> 00:15:53.458
Miss Tsugumi, turn into a flying halberd!

00:15:53.458 --> 00:15:55.417
Huh? I can't!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:00.250
Remember Miss Jacqueline! Imagine it!

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:03.250
Mm-hmm!

00:16:14.083 --> 00:16:16.792
Miss Tsugumi, I believe in your power.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:21.500
Knowing you, Miss Tsugumi, I'm sure you can fly.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.458
You did it!

00:16:46.458 --> 00:16:48.958
Whoa, the balance is tricky.

00:16:48.958 --> 00:16:50.583
Is that...

00:16:50.583 --> 00:16:52.458
Soul resonance.

00:16:52.458 --> 00:16:53.625
Huh?

00:16:53.625 --> 00:16:56.208
When a meister and weapon are
in close harmony with each other,

00:16:56.208 --> 00:17:01.333
they impart each other's feelings,
and are able to share imaginations.

00:17:01.333 --> 00:17:03.333
Soul resonance?

00:17:05.167 --> 00:17:10.167
Dr. Stein is making an antidote
based on Tatane's blood sample.

00:17:10.167 --> 00:17:11.583
Huh?!

00:17:11.583 --> 00:17:12.708
Hey, Akane!

00:17:12.708 --> 00:17:16.917
If I know Dr. Stein,
he has just about completed it.

00:17:16.917 --> 00:17:17.667
Hold on!

00:17:17.667 --> 00:17:19.292
Miss Anya, hop on!

00:17:19.292 --> 00:17:20.333
Right!

00:17:22.292 --> 00:17:26.208
Be careful, Harudori and Anya.

00:17:26.208 --> 00:17:27.667
Right!

00:17:27.667 --> 00:17:30.000
Here we go!

00:17:35.917 --> 00:17:39.333
Miss Anya, could you hop off,
and give us a running start?

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.000
Okay!

00:17:57.083 --> 00:17:58.875
Fly!

00:18:04.167 --> 00:18:05.333
Miss Tsugumi!

00:18:09.542 --> 00:18:11.375
Good luck!

00:18:12.917 --> 00:18:15.208
Aren't you a bit soft on Harudori?

00:18:15.208 --> 00:18:18.500
Am I? Harudori is cute, isn't she?

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.375
That doesn't make it right.

00:18:20.375 --> 00:18:22.917
We should get back to DWMA, too.

00:18:22.917 --> 00:18:24.250
Yeah.

00:18:32.583 --> 00:18:36.250
Wah! Miss Tsugumi, go slower!
The brakes! The brakes!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:37.750
Brakes?!

00:18:50.917 --> 00:18:52.583
I see.

00:18:52.583 --> 00:18:56.250
So please, give us the antidote!

00:18:56.250 --> 00:19:00.917
Nice and frank. Hmm, what should I do?

00:19:00.917 --> 00:19:06.000
What kind of indecisive attitude is that?!
Every second counts!

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:09.625
There are two reasons why
I shouldn't give this to you.

00:19:09.625 --> 00:19:10.542
Want to hear them?

00:19:10.542 --> 00:19:11.583
Hurry!

00:19:11.583 --> 00:19:16.625
Number one: At most, this drug
only breaks down the toxin inside,

00:19:16.625 --> 00:19:20.833
but its effects on any
mind control are still unclear.

00:19:20.833 --> 00:19:24.250
There's a chance it has no effect, of course...

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:26.458
...and in the worst-case scenario, she could die.

00:19:26.458 --> 00:19:28.125
Die?!

00:19:28.125 --> 00:19:30.208
Okay, I'm joking about that.

00:19:30.208 --> 00:19:32.417
Is this any time to be joking?!

00:19:32.417 --> 00:19:34.042
--If you don't cut it out, I'll take that screw in your head and...

00:19:34.042 --> 00:19:35.750
--What's the second?
--If you don't cut it out, I'll take that screw in your head and...

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:40.333
Naigus-<i>sensei </i>is currently
on her way over from DWMA

00:19:40.333 --> 00:19:41.958
to pick up this sample.

00:19:41.958 --> 00:19:43.458
--Huh?
--Mnh?

00:19:43.458 --> 00:19:45.833
She'll take this sample with her,

00:19:45.833 --> 00:19:48.208
then after verifying its
effectiveness in actual use,

00:19:48.208 --> 00:19:52.000
she'll mass produce it...
and you'll get it in about three days.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:55.333
What if something happens
to Meme in the meantime?!

00:19:57.417 --> 00:19:59.333
Dr. Stein...

00:19:59.333 --> 00:20:01.333
The sample!

00:20:01.333 --> 00:20:03.583
What are <i>you </i>doing in here?

00:20:03.583 --> 00:20:07.333
We came to get the antidote
so we could save Miss Meme!

00:20:07.333 --> 00:20:10.250
You're supposed to be on
your way to the airport, right?

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.958
Don't try anything foolish,
and just do as you're told.

00:20:12.958 --> 00:20:17.167
We're going to go test the drug's
effectiveness on Miss Meme! So--

00:20:17.167 --> 00:20:20.583
Don't be ridiculous!
What do you think you can do?!

00:20:20.583 --> 00:20:24.417
You have to trust us!
We're fighting against the same enemy!

00:20:24.417 --> 00:20:27.708
The enemy may be the same,
but we want to protect something else!

00:20:34.208 --> 00:20:37.375
The toxin should start being
neutralized as soon as she takes it.

00:20:37.375 --> 00:20:38.708
Go on, go on!

00:20:41.708 --> 00:20:45.083
We're sorry! We promise, we'll bring Meme back!

00:20:45.083 --> 00:20:46.917
Hold it!

00:20:46.917 --> 00:20:50.125
Dr. Stein, what do you think you're--

00:20:50.125 --> 00:20:52.042
There we are...

00:20:52.042 --> 00:20:55.042
It's fun to tease the girls, isn't it?

00:20:59.375 --> 00:21:01.875
We have to find Miss Meme quickly.

00:21:01.875 --> 00:21:04.458
It probably won't do any good
to search for her at random.

00:21:04.458 --> 00:21:07.167
But we don't have any other way.

00:21:07.167 --> 00:21:08.333
Unless, maybe...

00:21:08.333 --> 00:21:09.583
What is it?

00:21:09.583 --> 00:21:12.250
Clay said that there's a high probability

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.875
that Meme was at Shaula's side, remember?

00:21:14.875 --> 00:21:15.750
Yes.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.750
Then if we find Shaula first...

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:22.000
Is there a way to find a witch?

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:23.583
A messenger bat!

00:21:23.583 --> 00:21:24.750
Huh?

00:21:32.083 --> 00:21:34.292
That one was better than the one before, right?

00:21:34.292 --> 00:21:35.958
In what way?!

00:21:40.208 --> 00:21:42.917
Miss Anya, hurry! We're going after it!

00:21:42.917 --> 00:21:44.333
Geez!

00:21:52.125 --> 00:21:54.750
Now, kill each other!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:58.125
Color the town red with your blood,

00:21:58.125 --> 00:22:02.167
and blot out order with insanity!

00:22:02.167 --> 00:22:03.792
Kill them...

00:22:03.792 --> 00:22:09.208
--No one will be allowed to sleep.
--Kill them... Killed them... Kill them...

00:22:09.208 --> 00:22:13.542
--The festival ends, and the curtain now rises on chaos.
--Kill them... Killed them...

00:22:13.542 --> 00:22:16.625
Kill... Kill them...

00:22:18.542 --> 00:22:20.542
Miss Meme!

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:25.458
Miss Meme!

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:33.417
Meme! We're here!

00:22:33.417 --> 00:22:39.875
Kill them... Kill them...
Killed them... Kill... Kill them...

00:22:47.542 --> 00:22:51.708
<i>With a big wave and a "See you,"</i>

00:22:51.708 --> 00:22:58.625
<i>let's meet in the new day</i>

00:23:15.375 --> 00:23:19.542
<i>Our shadows stretch along the pavement</i>

00:23:19.542 --> 00:23:23.542
<i>coming together, then apart, then together</i>

00:23:23.542 --> 00:23:31.875
<i>What do I say when the road home ends?</i>

00:23:31.875 --> 00:23:36.042
<i>You are not alone. Nope, right nearby,</i>

00:23:36.042 --> 00:23:40.167
<i>there are eyes looking back at you</i>

00:23:40.167 --> 00:23:44.292
<i>And just like a miracle,</i>

00:23:44.292 --> 00:23:48.042
<i>they can turn even failures into laughter</i>

00:23:48.042 --> 00:23:52.167
<i>Thank you for a fun day</i>

00:23:52.167 --> 00:23:56.500
<i>Let's do it again tomorrow</i>

00:23:56.500 --> 00:24:00.583
<i>We'll open a brand-new door</i>

00:24:00.583 --> 00:24:04.750
<i>chasing after dreams and love</i>

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:10.375
<i>and those nameless feelings, too</i>

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:21.458
Under the witch's control, Meme attacks us!

00:24:21.458 --> 00:24:24.417
Miss Tsugumi, stay back! I will stop Miss Meme!

00:24:24.417 --> 00:24:26.750
Stop! I don't want to hurt anyone else...

00:24:26.750 --> 00:24:28.375
Here goes, everyone!

00:24:29.167 --> 00:24:32.064
"Next time: Soul Resonance!"
We're going to take back our cheerful lives!
